  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SampleInfoPanel
  title: "Test09 \xB7 Callbacks"
  description: 'The engine calls our methods: a code bumper (left), a trigger zone, a rope that breaks by callback (SPACE), and a component bumper using a UnityEvent (right).'
  apiUsed:
  - PhysicsCallbacks.IContactCallback (OnContactBegin2D)
  - PhysicsCallbacks.ITriggerCallback (OnTriggerBegin2D / End2D)
  - PhysicsCallbacks.IJointThresholdCallback (OnJointThreshold2D)
  - shape.callbackTarget / joint.callbackTarget
  - world.autoJointThresholdCallbacks
  - PhysicsDistanceJointDefinition.forceThreshold
  - 'Physics Area: Callback Source = Events + On Contact Begin (UnityEvent)'
  - 'Physics Area: Areas Only = off'
